tstring11.pp	gap: an open `array of WideChar` / `array of AnsiChar` argument binding a UnicodeString/RawByteString parameter. The overload KEY is no longer the blocker — under {$define PXX_WIDE_PAYLOAD} the two Test1 candidates are distinct and the refusal moves to the open-array conversion at line 42; without it they are one type (same alias gate as tover1)
